(6818986, 1025796, 144365, '<td valign="top">#1<br/>When I''m walking down the street, I purposely plow into people who are completely engrossed in their media. Here I see three potential victims.<br/> <br/>It''s sad this is what society has become. I get even more irate when out shopping somewhere and the person paying is on their cell phone while the cashier attempts to ask them questions. The ironic thing with this photo is all three people are probably <i>talking</i> to each other.</td>', '#1When I''m walking down the street, I purposely plow into people who are completely engrossed in their media. Here I see three potential victims. It''s sad this is what society has become. I get even more irate when out shopping somewhere and the person paying is on their cell phone while the cashier attempts to ask them questions. The ironic thing with this photo is all three people are probably talking to each other.', '2012-07-16 16:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6818989, 1025426, 144365, '<td valign="top">#2<br/>Simple. <br/>Signifies the current efforts of trying to get off our reliance on oil. The system is completely broken, especially in the US. When oil conglomerates can own some of the most innovative patents for electric cars you know there''s trouble. Then there''s the US government mandating the dilution of gasoline with ethanol so the corn industry doesn''t tank. And so on, and so on.</td>', '#2Simple. Signifies the current efforts of trying to get off our reliance on oil. The system is completely broken, especially in the US. When oil conglomerates can own some of the most innovative patents for electric cars you know there''s trouble. Then there''s the US government mandating the dilution of gasoline with ethanol so the corn industry doesn''t tank. And so on, and so on.', '2012-07-16 16:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6818991, 1025911, 144365, '<td valign="top">#3, tied with another.<br/> <br/>Clever idea but the image itself is a little flat. Gave it huge bonus points for the idea alone. Dark background, candlelit dinner, lion fur rug, fireplace roaring, ...</td>', '#3, tied with another. Clever idea but the image itself is a little flat. Gave it huge bonus points for the idea alone. Dark background, candlelit dinner, lion fur rug, fireplace roaring, ...', '2012-07-16 16:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
