(6823365, 1025753, 138630, '<td valign="top">Everyone has a cell phone these days.  I like the processing here - could use a little more light on his face.  Not so sure about the background - all those announcement sheets are very distracting but I think they are supposed to be part of the story here?  Good score from me.  Voted earlier.</td>', 'Everyone has a cell phone these days.  I like the processing here - could use a little more light on his face.  Not so sure about the background - all those announcement sheets are very distracting but I think they are supposed to be part of the story here?  Good score from me.  Voted earlier.', '2012-07-21 01:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
