(6823774, 1025872, 143116, '<td valign="top">I like the color and choice of PCB, but am not thrilled with the shot where nothing seems in focus and I do not know where to look. Did you try a lower viewpoint?</td>', 'I like the color and choice of PCB, but am not thrilled with the shot where nothing seems in focus and I do not know where to look. Did you try a lower viewpoint?', '2012-07-21 13:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6823776, 1025054, 103032, '<td valign="top">Pretty good concept. Like the melding of the old and new.</td>', 'Pretty good concept. Like the melding of the old and new.', '2012-07-21 13:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6823795, 1025899, 103032, '<td valign="top">The quality of the image is so so, looks like a camera phone snap. However, I do like the content and social commentary that the photo captures.</td>', 'The quality of the image is so so, looks like a camera phone snap. However, I do like the content and social commentary that the photo captures.', '2012-07-21 14:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6823806, 1025873, 103032, '<td valign="top">Main subject (and challenge topic being technology) being the pay phone, I think this photo would have been way stronger and more of a statement if you had the opportunity (staged or real) if you had captured a person walking by talking on their cellphone. Just a thought. This would be a good re-do.</td>', 'Main subject (and challenge topic being technology) being the pay phone, I think this photo would have been way stronger and more of a statement if you had the opportunity (staged or real) if you had captured a person walking by talking on their cellphone. Just a thought. This would be a good re-do.', '2012-07-21 14:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6823811, 1025909, 103032, '<td valign="top">Had to take a second look. Like the way the back of the iPhone is lighted, and how her face is illuminated by the "glow" if the phone. Leaving the rest of the photo dark to dimly lit is a great technique the focus the attention on the phone and the girl. Also fits the challenge topic. Nice work.</td>', 'Had to take a second look. Like the way the back of the iPhone is lighted, and how her face is illuminated by the "glow" if the phone. Leaving the rest of the photo dark to dimly lit is a great technique the focus the attention on the phone and the girl. Also fits the challenge topic. Nice work.', '2012-07-21 14:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6823813, 1025777, 103032, '<td valign="top">To be honest, the pic doesn''t "wow" me, but had to leave a comment that I do like the composition of filling the frame and I do like the inclusion of the sun.</td>', 'To be honest, the pic doesn''t "wow" me, but had to leave a comment that I do like the composition of filling the frame and I do like the inclusion of the sun.', '2012-07-21 14:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6823819, 1025679, 103032, '<td valign="top">Technically a great portrait; kid''s face is crisp, light is great for this pic. Let us know in your notes if this was only lit by the itouch, iPhone, and iPad. I''m only a third way through, but I would think this would end up in the top ten, if not ribbon (unless you get knocked by Apple haters).</td>', 'Technically a great portrait; kid''s face is crisp, light is great for this pic. Let us know in your notes if this was only lit by the itouch, iPhone, and iPad. I''m only a third way through, but I would think this would end up in the top ten, if not ribbon (unless you get knocked by Apple haters).', '2012-07-21 14:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6823828, 1025796, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice catch on the social statement. Like the b&amp;w processing. (Jagar?)</td>', 'Nice catch on the social statement. Like the b&w processing. (Jagar?)', '2012-07-21 14:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6823829, 1025787, 103032, '<td valign="top">Cool. Hope you have a YouTube vid for the GoPro, and a link :)</td>', 'Cool. Hope you have a YouTube vid for the GoPro, and a link :)', '2012-07-21 14:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6823830, 1025832, 103032, '<td valign="top">Good catch of old school verses modern tech. I think you could have cropped out a bit of the right side though. Would have been nice if she would have been facing you.</td>', 'Good catch of old school verses modern tech. I think you could have cropped out a bit of the right side though. Would have been nice if she would have been facing you.', '2012-07-21 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
