(6825022, 1025095, 123348, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture and it certainly deserves better than 74th place, but maybe one is one track minded when thinking of technology. The definition is as follows: <br/> <br/>tech·nol·o·gy<br/> <br/>noun&amp;#8195;/tek&amp;#712;näl&amp;#601;j&amp;#275;/&amp;#8195;<br/>technologies, plural<br/> <br/>    The application of scientific knowledge for practical purposes, esp. in industry<br/>        - advances in computer technology<br/>        - recycling technologies<br/> <br/>    Machinery and equipment developed from such scientific knowledge<br/> <br/>    The branch of knowledge dealing with engineering or applied sciences. <br/>You thought outside the box!! Wonderful image and to me, from what you described,it is the newest form of technology that messes with the ecosystem on a global level. Modern day rain making...</td>', 'Awesome picture and it certainly deserves better than 74th place, but maybe one is one track minded when thinking of technology. The definition is as follows:  tech·nol·o·gy noun&#8195;/tek&#712;näl&#601;j&#275;/&#8195;technologies, plural     The application of scientific knowledge for practical purposes, esp. in industry        - advances in computer technology        - recycling technologies     Machinery and equipment developed from such scientific knowledge     The branch of knowledge dealing with engineering or applied sciences. You thought outside the box!! Wonderful image and to me, from what you described,it is the newest form of technology that messes with the ecosystem on a global level. Modern day rain making...', '2012-07-23 01:56:23.000000', NULL, 0),
