(6825501, 1025095, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> I think this image suffered from the context paradox - <u>you</u> know the back story here, but we don''t, so it doesn''t mean the same to us as it does to you. A stellar image in the "wrong" challenge. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>True enough.  It''s been a stressful time in my life.  I am struggling with life events, which leaves little time for my beloved photography.  This, too, shall pass.  Thanks for your comments.</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: I think this image suffered from the context paradox - you know the back story here, but we don''t, so it doesn''t mean the same to us as it does to you. A stellar image in the "wrong" challenge.  True enough.  It''s been a stressful time in my life.  I am struggling with life events, which leaves little time for my beloved photography.  This, too, shall pass.  Thanks for your comments.', '2012-07-23 15:19:15.000000', NULL, 0),
